&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;Reporting to the VP, Product for Diligent Market Intelligence, you will lead the strategy,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;roadmap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and evolution of Stewardship Intelligence—one of DMI’s core data products. Stewardship Intelligence provides&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;meeting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;, executive compensation, corporate governance and proxy-voting intelligence to institutional asset managers, stewardship and governance professionals, compensation advisers and consultants, and corporate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;issuers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:180,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:180}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
